  "description": "Rich text editor for Blazor (.NET 10) with keyboard accessibility, ARIA support, emoji picker (1800+ emojis via BlazorEmo), emoji autocomplete, XSS protection. Tested on Chrome, Edge, Firefox. Native Blazor component. GPL-3.0 for open-source projects.",
