  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0 Keyboard Accessibility (2026-02-20)\n\nAdded:\n- Toolbar keyboard navigation (Arrow keys, Home, End)\n- Dropdown keyboard support (ArrowDown opens, Escape closes)\n- Pending format support (Bold/Italic/Underline with no selection)\n- Firefox Ctrl+B/I/U keyboard shortcut support\n- Source Link for debugging\n- GPL-3.0 license headers in source files\n\nFixed:\n- Firefox browser shortcuts conflicting with editor formatting\n- Toolbar button focus management\n\nTested on: Chrome, Edge, Firefox\nNot tested: Safari\n\nSee: https://github.com/simscon1/BlazorRTE/blob/master/Docs/CHANGELOG.md",
